<title>GERMANY: Tietmeyer - forex to play role in EMU selection.</title>
<headline>Tietmeyer - forex to play role in EMU selection.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank President Hans Tietmeyer said on Thursday that exchange rate criteria for membership in the planned single European currency would play a &quot;decisive role&quot; in the selection of initial participants.</p>
<p>&quot;Exchange rate critiera will play a decisive role in the determiniation of members in the new currency,&quot; Tietmeyer said in a question-and-answer session at a Frankfurt conference sponsored by investment house Goldman Sachs.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
